    "description": "The forest troll has a hunched muscular body with brown, sometimes green skin. Its nose is as long as its ears. The fangs emerging from its mouth are less sturdy than those of other trolls. Its teeth are nevertheless razor-sharp. It paints its body with blue mud, also called pig mud.",
